{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14530","headline":"赠司空拾遗 · 戴叔伦","name":"赠司空拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侍臣何事辞云陛，江上弹冠见雪花。\n望阙未承丹凤诏，开门空对楚人家。\n陈琳草奏才还在，王粲登楼兴不赊。\n高馆更容尘外客，仍令归去待琼华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}